{
  "id": "p10-a-29",
  "title_zh": "暂不把缓存改进称为整机突破",
  "topic_id": "reasoning",
  "scenario": {
    "id": "prototype-buffer-test-claim-scope",
    "label_zh": "限定原型缓存测试的结论",
    "goal_zh": "区分原型缓存暂存更多读数的表现与整机长期可靠性，并约定补做对照及长时间测试"
  },
  "participants": [
    "Iris",
    "Omar"
  ],
  "context_zh": "设备研发同事核对原型的一次短时测试报告。",
  "author": "author-phase10-a",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "p10-a-29-s01",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "text": "The larger buffer held more readings before transmission. Can we call that a breakthrough?"
    },
    {
      "id": "p10-a-29-s02",
      "speaker": "Omar",
      "text": "Not yet. It shows a useful capability, but it was only a ten-minute run."
    },
    {
      "id": "p10-a-29-s03",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "text": "There was no breakdown during the run, though."
    },
    {
      "id": "p10-a-29-s04",
      "speaker": "Omar",
      "text": "True, but that doesn't establish long-term reliability. We also changed the connection settings."
    },
    {
      "id": "p10-a-29-s05",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "text": "So we can't attribute the whole improvement to the buffer alone."
    },
    {
      "id": "p10-a-29-s06",
      "speaker": "Omar",
      "text": "Exactly. Let's compare the two buffer sizes with the same settings, then run the better version for longer."
    },
    {
      "id": "p10-a-29-s07",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "text": "Agreed. I'll describe this as an initial result and add those tests to the plan."
    }
  ],
